<item>
<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-10-25T22:42:06.940Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 22:42:06 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Algeria's upper house and Senate have approved a historic deployment of soldiers to Niger to protect energy assets, marking a policy shift toward direct involvement in the Sahel conflict. In eastern Nigeria gunmen killed at least ten people, while separate motorbike gunmen killed at least twenty in a Nigerian village, showing continued violence against civilians. Mali's military has raised the death toll from a recent attack to fifty-four, indicating intensified fighting there. Ghana is working to prevent the war in Burkina Faso from spilling into its territory, reflecting regional concerns about the conflict's spread. The conflict produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPd3JYZFNoY2xFd1AzTzZmUlhHZllmcUFvTlY5WWJuYVp5YjktQzExZ0swU2hBLWMzMDh1OEdVSmMxY2hrbVIzeTZxYWk5T2pMX2VQVnZtVlRCcjdUT0xPV2JmX2hHNDQxdi1aOTVGV3RTdjdLc1I1eUk3QmNiUmYzb1RQNGpURklDRUIxNEpVb2drQW9NY3ZJMW5CczNvTnVjdTl3THZrc1IwTU9URkVDYWZn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Tomorrow's Affairs&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxNSE8xTG9RMk1HR1RjMjJZV2VsTmJLNE41QUJhaGZWOTJUOEJPVndPVkRiWVhDRXduZ1otTllfYVFQSXVaZ0JIaVRHQWNQTzE1MEVldHZXQjg5YVV4TllZSUQwM3hvLXE5dWV3dVo2aVhKMHZaTmN1SzJBZ2owZXBEdDR4WnpmRVlNT1pvRDVsRzNJcXVaSGJvUDN2dGVxekZxZ2hz?oc=5&quot;&gt;entrevue.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE1oanFaZ1V1eDl1MVktaWk1T3h3T3pQOVdCbmk1T0otdmY2MU05WTFFZW1NcUhrMVhPVVVTaFRlOHJlUDVYV1NyQnR4QWJNeExZQnNRd0dGUFY?o